<title>AZERBAIJAN: SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT AZERBAIJAN 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HUNGARY BEAT AZERBAIJAN 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BAKU 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary beat Azerbaijan 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their World Cup European group three soccer</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Elek Nyilas 43, 67 penalty, Florian Urban 78.</p>
<p>Attendance: 31,000</p>
</text>
